</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.840" end="00:29.820"><span begin="00:27.840" end="00:27.990">The </span><span begin="00:27.990" end="00:28.740">doctors </span><span begin="00:28.740" end="00:29.070">say </span><span begin="00:29.070" end="00:29.250">I'm </span><span begin="00:29.250" end="00:29.820">crazy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.820" end="00:31.380"><span begin="00:29.820" end="00:30.120">That </span><span begin="00:30.120" end="00:30.330">I'm </span><span begin="00:30.330" end="00:30.570">eight </span><span begin="00:30.570" end="00:31.020">miles </span><span begin="00:31.020" end="00:31.380">thicks</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.620" end="00:33.780"><span begin="00:31.620" end="00:31.800">I'm </span><span begin="00:31.800" end="00:32.100">like </span><span begin="00:32.100" end="00:32.220">the </span><span begin="00:32.220" end="00:32.640">taste </span><span begin="00:32.640" end="00:32.730">of </span><span begin="00:32.730" end="00:33.780">macaroni</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.780" end="00:35.880"><span begin="00:33.780" end="00:34.140">on </span><span begin="00:34.140" end="00:34.200">a </span><span begin="00:34.200" end="00:34.920">seafood </span><span begin="00:34.920" end="00:35.880">stick</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.880" end="00:37.290"><span begin="00:35.880" end="00:35.970">You </span><span begin="00:35.970" end="00:36.540">got </span><span begin="00:36.540" end="00:36.660">me </span><span begin="00:36.660" end="00:37.140">switched </span><span begin="00:37.140" end="00:37.290">on</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.290" end="00:39.570"><span begin="00:37.290" end="00:37.770">Baby</span><span begin="00:37.770" end="00:37.770">, </span><span begin="00:37.770" end="00:38.160">like </span><span begin="00:38.160" end="00:39.060">electric </span><span begin="00:39.060" end="00:39.570">eel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.570" end="00:41.790"><span begin="00:39.570" end="00:39.870">And </span><span begin="00:39.870" end="00:39.990">I'm </span><span begin="00:39.990" end="00:40.560">tight </span><span begin="00:40.560" end="00:40.890">with </span><span begin="00:40.890" end="00:41.280">Axel </span><span begin="00:41.280" end="00:41.790">Foley</span><span begin="00:41.790" end="00:41.790">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.790" end="00:43.560"><span begin="00:41.790" end="00:42.090">That's </span><span begin="00:42.090" end="00:42.360">just </span><span begin="00:42.360" end="00:42.660">how </span><span begin="00:42.660" end="00:42.960">I </span><span begin="00:42.960" end="00:43.560">feel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.560" end="00:46.050"><span begin="00:43.560" end="00:43.890">Like </span><span begin="00:43.890" end="00:43.980">a </span><span begin="00:43.980" end="00:44.910">grapefruit </span><span begin="00:44.910" end="00:45.120">an </span><span begin="00:45.120" end="00:45.210">a </span><span begin="00:45.210" end="00:45.780">magic </span><span begin="00:45.780" end="00:46.050">trick</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.050" end="00:47.550"><span begin="00:46.050" end="00:46.200">The </span><span begin="00:46.200" end="00:46.950">Prodigal </span><span begin="00:46.950" end="00:47.550">Son</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.850" end="00:48.600"><span begin="00:47.850" end="00:48.090">I'm </span><span begin="00:48.090" end="00:48.600">walking</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.840" end="00:49.590"><span begin="00:48.840" end="00:49.050">I'm </span><span begin="00:49.050" end="00:49.590">walking</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.830" end="00:50.640"><span begin="00:49.830" end="00:50.040">I'm </span><span begin="00:50.040" end="00:50.640">walking</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.640" end="00:53.280"><span begin="00:50.640" end="00:50.850">I </span><span begin="00:50.850" end="00:51.390">walk </span><span begin="00:51.390" end="00:51.960">so </span><span begin="00:51.960" end="00:53.280">quick</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.580" end="00:57.180"><span begin="00:53.580" end="00:53.880">And </span><span begin="00:53.880" end="00:53.970">it </span><span begin="00:53.970" end="00:54.570">just </span><span begin="00:54.570" end="00:54.930">don't </span><span begin="00:54.930" end="00:55.380">mean </span><span begin="00:55.380" end="00:55.440">a </span><span begin="00:55.440" end="00:57.180">thing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.600" end="01:01.380"><span begin="00:57.600" end="00:57.750">We've </span><span begin="00:57.750" end="00:58.050">been </span><span begin="00:58.050" end="00:59.040">waiting </span><span begin="00:59.040" end="00:59.460">far </span><span begin="00:59.460" end="01:00.030">too </span><span begin="01:00.030" end="01:01.380">long</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.860" end="01:05.220"><span begin="01:01.860" end="01:01.980">We'll </span><span begin="01:01.980" end="01:02.670">play </span><span begin="01:02.670" end="01:03.150">it </span><span begin="01:03.150" end="01:03.420">out </span><span begin="01:03.420" end="01:05.220">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.490" end="01:09.150"><span begin="01:05.490" end="01:05.910">This </span><span begin="01:05.910" end="01:06.030">is </span><span begin="01:06.030" end="01:06.540">just </span><span begin="01:06.540" end="01:06.870">my </span><span begin="01:06.870" end="01:09.150">serenade</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.480" end="01:13.200"><span begin="01:09.480" end="01:09.960">You're </span><span begin="01:09.960" end="01:10.050">in </span><span begin="01:10.050" end="01:10.560">love </span><span begin="01:10.560" end="01:10.890">with </span><span begin="01:10.890" end="01:10.920">a </span><span begin="01:10.920" end="01:13.200">psycho</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.470" end="01:17.430"><span begin="01:13.470" end="01:13.950">You're </span><span begin="01:13.950" end="01:14.070">in </span><span begin="01:14.070" end="01:14.580">love </span><span begin="01:14.580" end="01:14.880">with </span><span begin="01:14.880" end="01:14.970">a </span><span begin="01:14.970" end="01:17.430">psycho</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.430" end="01:21.330"><span begin="01:17.430" end="01:17.850">And </span><span begin="01:17.850" end="01:18.330">there's </span><span begin="01:18.330" end="01:18.870">nothing </span><span begin="01:18.870" end="01:19.020">you </span><span begin="01:19.020" end="01:19.290">can </span><span begin="01:19.290" end="01:19.650">do </span><span begin="01:19.650" end="01:20.670">about </span><span begin="01:20.670" end="01:21.330">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.330" end="01:25.200"><span begin="01:21.330" end="01:22.200">I </span><span begin="01:22.200" end="01:22.620">got </span><span begin="01:22.620" end="01:22.800">you </span><span begin="01:22.800" end="01:23.400">running </span><span begin="01:23.400" end="01:23.940">all </span><span begin="01:23.940" end="01:24.660">around </span><span begin="01:24.660" end="01:25.200">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.470" end="01:29.130"><span begin="01:25.470" end="01:25.950">You're </span><span begin="01:25.950" end="01:26.160">in </span><span begin="01:26.160" end="01:26.550">love </span><span begin="01:26.550" end="01:26.880">with </span><span begin="01:26.880" end="01:26.910">a </span><span begin="01:26.910" end="01:29.130">psycho</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.460" end="01:33.390"><span begin="01:29.460" end="01:29.940">You're </span><span begin="01:29.940" end="01:30.030">in </span><span begin="01:30.030" end="01:30.540">love </span><span begin="01:30.540" end="01:30.900">with </span><span begin="01:30.900" end="01:30.990">a </span><span begin="01:30.990" end="01:33.390">psycho</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.390" end="01:37.410"><span begin="01:33.390" end="01:33.840">And </span><span begin="01:33.840" end="01:34.320">there's </span><span begin="01:34.320" end="01:34.860">nothing </span><span begin="01:34.860" en