220">to </span><span begin="01:50.220" end="01:50.580">share </span><span begin="01:50.580" end="01:50.940">my </span><span begin="01:50.940" end="01:51.480">chips</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.570" end="01:52.620"><span begin="01:51.570" end="01:51.870">But </span><span begin="01:51.870" end="01:51.990">you're </span><span begin="01:51.990" end="01:52.620">walking</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.830" end="01:53.610"><span begin="01:52.830" end="01:53.220">You're </span><span begin="01:53.220" end="01:53.610">walking</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.760" end="01:54.570"><span begin="01:53.760" end="01:54.000">You </span><span begin="01:54.000" end="01:54.570">walk</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.570" end="01:56.310"><span begin="01:54.570" end="01:54.810">You </span><span begin="01:54.810" end="01:55.380">walk </span><span begin="01:55.380" end="01:55.860">so </span><span begin="01:55.860" end="01:56.310">quick</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.700" end="02:00.240"><span begin="01:56.700" end="01:57.840">Nobody's </span><span begin="01:57.840" end="01:58.200">gonna </span><span begin="01:58.200" end="01:58.620">take </span><span begin="01:58.620" end="01:58.710">you </span><span begin="01:58.710" end="02:00.240">there</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.540" end="02:04.110"><span begin="02:00.540" end="02:00.660">I </span><span begin="02:00.660" end="02:01.170">stick </span><span begin="02:01.170" end="02:01.830">around </span><span begin="02:01.830" end="02:02.100">for </span><span begin="02:02.100" end="02:02.220">the </span><span begin="02:02.220" end="02:02.820">thousand </span><span begin="02:02.820" end="02:03.210">yard </span><span begin="02:03.210" end="02:04.110">stare</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.560" end="02:07.920"><span begin="02:04.560" end="02:04.800">I </span><span begin="02:04.800" end="02:05.100">go </span><span begin="02:05.100" end="02:05.220">to </span><span begin="02:05.220" end="02:0